sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Household resident or rescuer
    participant App as Mobile app
    participant Store as Account-scoped snapshots
    participant Nav as Navigation SQLite and event outbox
    participant API as Laravel API
    U->>App: Open authenticated workspace
    App->>Store: Read last successful overview for current account token
    Store-->>App: Saved complete page data if present
    App->>API: Attempt fresh overview read
    alt Server reachable
        API-->>App: Latest permitted overview
        App->>Store: Replace snapshot and successful-sync timestamp
    else Server unavailable
        App->>App: Preserve complete saved page and show Offline mode
        Note over U,Store: First use without a successful sync cannot display nonexistent data
    end
    opt Rescuer trip with compatible prepared offline assets
        U->>App: Record trip/location events
        App->>Nav: Persist supported navigation outbox events
        App->>API: Replay supported events after reconnect
        API-->>App: Idempotent acknowledgment or validation failure
    end
    Note over U,API: Household status-submission outbox remains a required gap
    Note over U,API: Cached pages do not guarantee offline map tiles, routes or radio
